{:tier :glm-5.2, :verse 29, :comments ["<b>And he offered upon it, etc.</b> Also on the eighth day of the ordinations — which is the day of the erection of the Mishkan — Moses served and offered the public offerings, besides those they were commanded on that day, as it says ״קְרַב אֶל הַמִּזְבֵּחַ״ etc. (Leviticus 9)." "<b>The burnt offering.</b> The daily burnt offering." "<b>And the meal offering.</b> The libation meal offering of the daily offering, as it says ״וְעִשָּׂרֹן סֹלֶת בָּלוּל בְּשֶׁמֶן״ etc. (Exodus 29)."], :book :exodus, :voice :rashi, :lang :en, :chapter 40, :notes {}, :source-witnesses nil, :timestamp "2026-08-02T08:56:59.046096312Z", :translated-from :he, :model "glm-5.2"}